        <a href="https://optimization.cbe.cornell.edu/index.php?title=Stochastic_dynamic_programming" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><small>Cornell Optimization Wiki</small><strong><span class="ui-copy-en">Stochastic dynamic programming</span><span class="ui-copy-zh">随机动态规划</span></strong><span><span class="ui-copy-en">A compact introduction to stochastic dynamic programming and its role in decision-making under uncertainty.</span><span class="ui-copy-zh">对随机动态规划及其在不确定决策中的作用进行紧凑介绍。</span></span></a>
